 for 2 hours.</span></div></div><div class="section">02 | TURNOVER &amp; WITHDRAWAL</div><div class="row"><div class="symbol">◆</div><div class="detail"><span class="label">TURNOVER</span><span class="value gold">Minimum Withdraw $100</span></div></div><div class="row"><div class="symbol">$</div><div class="detail"><span class="label">MAX WITHDRAW</span><span class="value">Max <span class="gold">Withdraw AUD 10 ( Will Convert into valid deposit )</span></span></div></div><div class="section">03 | GAME RESTRICTIONS</div><div class="warning"><div class="warning-title">✘ NOT ALLOWED</div><div class="warning-text">Save Free Games / Buy Free Games / Mix Bonus / Mix Deposit</div></div><div class="section">04 | IMPORTANT NOTICE</div><div class="notice"><strong style="color:#ffda70">⚠ VALID GAMES ONLY</strong><div style="margin-top:5px">This Promotion only valid for Event SLOT GAME ONLY.</div></div><div class="section">05 | TELEGRAM CHANNEL</div><div class="telegram"><div class="telegram-title">JOIN THE LATEST WALLET CHANNEL</div><a href="https://telegram.me/playtowinOfficialAUS" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">⬆⬆⬆ JOIN FREE TRUSTED WALLET Telegram Channel</a></div></div>

