il"><span class="label">REQUIREMENTS</span><span class="value gold">NO</span></div></div><div class="row"><div class="symbol">★</div><div class="detail"><span class="label">CLAIM LIMIT</span><span class="value gold">ONE TIME PER DAY</span></div></div><div class="section">02 | WINOVER &amp; WITHDRAWAL</div><div class="row"><div class="symbol">◆</div><div class="detail"><span class="label">WINOVER</span><span class="value gold">CREDIT MUST HIT $500</span></div></div><div class="row"><div class="symbol">$</div><div class="detail"><span class="label">MAX WITHDRAWAL</span><span class="value gold">$5 ( Will Convert Valid Deposit )</span></div></div><div class="section">03 | VALID GAMES &amp; RESTRICTIONS</div><div class="row"><div class="symbol">✓</div><div class="detail"><span class="label">VALID FOR</span><span class="value gold">LIMITED EVENT SLOT GAME</span></div></div><div class="warning"><div class="warning-title">✘ NOT ALLOWED</div><div class="warning-text">Buy Feature &amp; Save Free &amp; Save Red Envelope</div></div><div class="section">04 | IMPORTANT NOTICES</div><div class="notice"><strong style="color:#ffda70">⚠ PROMOTION CONDITION</strong><div style="margin-top:5px">This Promotion Cannot Be Used In Conjunction With Other Promotions</div></div><div class="warning"><div class="warning-title">⚠ REGISTRATION INFORMATION</div><div class="warning-text">If Registration Information Is Found To Be Incorrect During The Withdrawal , Amount Will Be Forfeited</div></div><div class="section">05 | TELEGRAM GAME TIPS</div><div class="telegram"><a href="https://telegram.me/Vivian1Win_Bot" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">JOIN TELEGRAM GAME TIPS</a></div><div class="section">06 | GENERAL TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</div><div class="terms"><div class="terms-heading">General</div><p>Terms &amp; Conditions apply. If any illegal betting, suspicious behavior, bonus abuse, side betting, or saving free games to play later and then depositing to withdraw is detected, your deposit, including any winnings and bonuses, may be frozen. The system may also reset your account balance to zero (0).</p></div></div></p><p><br></p>"}

