v class="flex bg-white align-center item-right" style="border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0; padding: 10px;"> <p><span class="tc-black"><strong>Bug Game, Buy Free Game, Save Free Game, Save Free Angpao</strong></span></p></div></div></div><h2 class="tc-primary br-50 border-primary fw-700" style="padding:5px 15px;font-size:16px;text-align:center">TERMS & CONDITIONS </h2><div class="flex flex-col w-100 rules" style="gap: 15px;padding-left: 15px;"><div class="flex" style="text-transform: uppercase;gap:15px;align-items:center;"><i class="icon-tnc"></i> <p class="text-left" style="font-size: 10px;"><span class="tc-white"><strong>Multiple accounts are not eligible for claims or withdrawals</strong></span></p></div><div class="flex" style="text-transform: uppercase;gap:15px;align-items:center;"><i class="icon-tnc"></i> <p class="text-left" style="font-size: 10px;"><span class="tc-white"><strong>Register Name Must Match Your Bank Account</strong></span></p></div><div class="flex" style="text-transform: uppercase;gap:15px;align-items:center;"><i class="icon-tnc"></i><p class="text-left" style="font-size: 10px;"><span class="tc-white"><strong>Bank Account Changes Upon Withdrawal Are Not Allowed</strong></span> </p></div><div class="flex" style="text-transform: uppercase;gap:15px;align-items:center;"><i class="icon-tnc"></i><p class="text-left" style="font-size: 10px;"><span class="tc-white"><strong>Violation Of Terms May Result In Bonus And Balance Forfeiture</strong></span> </p></div><div class="flex" style="text-transform: uppercase;gap:15px;align-items:center;"><i class="icon-tnc"></i><p class="text-left" style="font-size: 10px;"><span class="tc-white"><strong>AVATARR8 Reserves The Right To Final Interpretation And Changes</strong></span> </p></div></div><h2 class="tc-primary br-50 border-primary fw-700" style="padding:5px 15px;font-size:16px;text-align:center"><strong>GENERAL TERMS</strong></h2><div class="flex flex-col w-100 rules" style="gap: 15px;padding-left: 0px;"><div class